  "swarm — compagnon local de reprise (schema_version: 1)\n\nOptions globales : --root <projet> --json --lang fr|en\nswarm init\nswarm doctor\nswarm aide [sujet]\nswarm providers init|show\nswarm providers cooldown show|clear <fournisseur> [--input demande.json]\nswarm connections list|save --input connexion.json\nswarm console [travail] [--plain]\nswarm prepare list|methods|show|history|create|save|method|adopt-brief|validate-plan|export\nswarm dispatch <travail>\nswarm autonomy <travail> [manuel|assiste|autonome] [créneaux]\nswarm mission status|preview|start|pause|resume|stop|watch <travail> [--input profil.json]\nswarm lifecycle list\nswarm lifecycle preview|apply <travail> archive|restore|purge|delete --input requete.json\nswarm validation preview|apply <travail> --task <tâche> --input politique.json\nswarm profile <travail> [tâche] [--input profil.json]\nswarm control <travail> --input commande.json\nswarm agent start <travail> --input lancement.json\nswarm agent prepared <travail>\nswarm agent resume-launch <travail> --input reprise.json\nswarm agent preflight <travail> --input lancement.json\nswarm agent list <travail>\nswarm agent show|stop|reconcile <agent>\nswarm agent logs <agent> [après_seq] [--output nouveau.jsonl]\nswarm exchange list <travail>\nswarm exchange send|consume <travail> --input requête.json\nswarm workspace status <travail>\nswarm workspace integrate <travail> --input manifeste.json\nswarm planning show|enable|claim|decide|handoff|step|authorize-recovery|pause|resume <travail> [--input requête.json]\nswarm work create --input fichier.json\nswarm work update <travail> --input fichier.json\nswarm work list\nswarm work show <travail>\nswarm task add|update <travail> --input fichier.json\nswarm checkpoint <travail> --input fichier.json\nswarm ooda <travail> --input fichier.json\nswarm gate <travail> --task <tâche> --input requête.json\nswarm resume [travail]\nswarm export <travail> --output archive.zip\nswarm import --input archive.zip\nswarm evaluate --input evidence.json [--phase delivery]\n\nLes mutations exigent schema_version, event_id et expected_revision.\nUne gate attend aussi task_id, phase, document (méthode d’évaluation 2).\nLes requêtes sont décrites dans README.md. --input - lit stdin.\nCodes généraux : 0 succès ; 1 gate bloquée ; 2 erreur.\nPréparer : 2 contrat ; 3 conflit ; 4 autorisation ; 5 fournisseur ou méthode indisponible ; 6 arrêt non confirmé.\n": "swarm — local agent coordination (schema_version: 1)\n\nGlobal options: --root <project> --json --lang fr|en\nswarm init\nswarm doctor\nswarm aide [topic]\nswarm providers init|show\nswarm providers cooldown show|clear <provider> [--input request.json]\nswarm connections list|save --input connection.json\nswarm console [work] [--plain]\nswarm prepare list|methods|show|history|create|save|method|adopt-brief|validate-plan|export\nswarm dispatch <work>\nswarm autonomy <work> [manuel|assiste|autonome] [slots]\nswarm mission status|preview|start|pause|resume|stop|watch <work> [--input profile.json]\nswarm lifecycle list\nswarm lifecycle preview|apply <work> archive|restore|purge|delete --input request.json\nswarm validation preview|apply <work> --task <task> --input policy.json\nswarm profile <work> [task] [--input profile.json]\nswarm control <work> --input command.json\nswarm agent start <work> --input launch.json\nswarm agent prepared <work>\nswarm agent resume-launch <work> --input recovery.json\nswarm agent preflight <work> --input launch.json\nswarm agent list <work>\nswarm agent show|stop|reconcile <agent>\nswarm agent logs <agent> [after_seq] [--output new.jsonl]\nswarm exchange list <work>\nswarm exchange send|consume <work> --input request.json\nswarm workspace status <work>\nswarm workspace integrate <work> --input manifest.json\nswarm planning show|enable|claim|decide|handoff|step|authorize-recovery|pause|resume <work> [--input request.json]\nswarm work create --input file.json\nswarm work update <work> --input file.json\nswarm work list\nswarm work show <work>\nswarm task add|update <work> --input file.json\nswarm checkpoint <work> --input file.json\nswarm ooda <work> --input file.json\nswarm gate <work> --task <task> --input request.json\nswarm resume [work]\nswarm export <work> --output archive.zip\nswarm import --input archive.zip\nswarm evaluate --input evidence.json [--phase delivery]\n\nMutations require schema_version, event_id and expected_revision.\nA gate also requires task_id, phase and document (evaluation method 2).\nSee REFERENCE.md for request schemas. --input - reads stdin.\nGeneral exit codes: 0 success; 1 blocked gate; 2 error.\nPreparation: 2 contract; 3 conflict; 4 authorization; 5 provider/method unavailable; 6 stop unconfirmed.\nLanguage: --lang fr|en overrides SWARM_LANG; default fr. JSON identifiers and slash commands do not change.\n",
